<title>USA: HighwayMaster gets FTC okay for SBC deal.</title>
<headline>HighwayMaster gets FTC okay for SBC deal.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>HighwayMaster Corp, a subsidiary of HighwayMaster Communications Inc, said on Monday that it has received notice the Federal Trade Commission granted early termination of the Hart-Scott-Rodino waiting period, allowing completion of a $20 million investment in the company by SBC Communications Inc.</p>
</text>
